  * Absolute neutrophil count ≥1.5×109/L;
  * Platelet ≥100×109 /L;
  * Hemoglobin ≥90g/L;
  * Total bilirubin \< 1.5 ULN;
  * ALT and/or AST \< 1.5 ULN ;
